MURA, SUZUSHI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NISHIMURA SUZUSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NISHIMURA, SUZUSHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An optical laminate comprising, laminated in the order mentioned, a support substrate, adhesive layer, cholesteric liquid crystal layer and protection layer, characterized in that the cholesteric liquid crystal layer has in at least part thereof an area indicating a diffraction power. The optical laminate is used for a polarization diffraction element, liquid crystal display device compensation element, decorative member, and forgery prevention element.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Ce stratifié optique comprend, dans l'ordre mentionné, un substrat de support, une couche adhésive, une couche de cristaux liquides cholestérique et une couche de protection, déposés par stratification. Ce stratifié se caractérise en ce que la couche de cristaux liquides cholestérique comporte dans une partie au moins une zone indiquant un pouvoir de diffraction. Ce stratifié optique est utilisé dans des éléments de diffraction de polarisation, des éléments de compensation de dispositifs d'affichage à cristaux liquides, des éléments décoratifs et des éléments de prévention des contrefaçons.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facil